":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e45","entries":[45,45],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"Lina Park","bound":false},"text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"07:04","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e46","entries":[46,48],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"读取","title":"读取 1 个文件","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","md":[["p",[[0,45]]]],"first":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","entries":[46],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Read","hint":"src/views/views.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"src/views/views.ts","result":"自建 runner 上缓存命中率现在 87%，平均 CI 时间从 14 分钟降到 6 分 40 秒。还有 arm64 的 Android 构建没迁，等新机器到。","entries":[47,48],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e49","entries":[49,49],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"左子健","bound":false},"text":"合吧","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"07:08","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e50","entries":[50,52],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"运行","title":"运行 1 条命令","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","md":[["p",[[0,118]]]],"first":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 