startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out.","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"07:24","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e66","entries":[66,68],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"读取","title":"读取 1 个文件","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","md":[["p",[[0,8],["a",[[8,45]],{"href":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","bare":true,"to":{"peek":"pull"}}],[45,62]]]],"first":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","entries":[66],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Read","hint":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","result":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","entries":[67,68],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e69","entries":[69,69],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"Lina Park","bound":false},"text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"07:28","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e70","entries":[70,72],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"运行","title":"运行 1 条命令","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","md":[["p",[[0,45]]]],"first":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","entries":[70],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Bash","hint":"src/views/views.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","fail