content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"Lina Park","bound":false},"text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"08:16","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e118","entries":[118,120],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"搜索","title":"搜索 1 次","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","md":[["p",[[0,45]]]],"first":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","entries":[118],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Grep","hint":"src/views/views.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"src/views/views.ts","result":"自建 runner 上缓存命中率现在 87%，平均 CI 时间从 14 分钟降到 6 分 40 秒。还有 arm64 的 Android 构建没迁，等新机器到。","entries":[119,120],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e121","entries":[121,121],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[{"text":"后台命令完成：pnpm test --filter core","agent":false,"failed":false}],"messages":[]}},"turn":{"time":"08:20","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e122","entries":[122,124],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"编辑","title":"编辑 1 个文件","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","md":[["p",[[0,118]]]],"first":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","entries":[122],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Edit","hint":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","result":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","entries":[123,124],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e125","entries":[125,125],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"Lina Park","bound":false},"text":"Here's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out.","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"08:24","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e126","entries":[126,128],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"读取","title":"读取 1 个文件","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","md":[["p",[[0,8],["a",[[8,45]],{"href":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","bare":true,"to":{"peek":"pull"}}],[45,62]]]],"first":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","entries":[126],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Read","hint":"src/views/views.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"src/views/views.ts","result":"日志轮转改成按天切了，保留 14 天，旧的压缩成 .gz。重启 station 之后看了一下 ~/.stillfail/logs，文件名是 station-2026-11-10.log，没问题。","entries":[127,128],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e129","entries":[129,129],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"左子健","bound":false},"text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","place":{"name"