"key":"e138","entries":[138,140],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"搜索","title":"搜索 1 次","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","md":[["p",[[0,8],["a",[[8,45]],{"href":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","bare":true,"to":{"peek":"pull"}}],[45,62]]]],"first":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","entries":[138],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Grep","hint":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","result":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","entries":[139,140],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e141","entries":[141,141],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"Lina Park","bound":false},"text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。\n\nTests pass locally and on CI. The flake was a race between the window becoming key and the first click; waiting for the named event fixed it in 200 runs.","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"08:40","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e142","entries":[142,144],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"编辑","title":"编辑 1 个文件","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","md":[["p",[[0,45]]]],"first":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。","entries":[142],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Edit","hint":"src/views/views.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"src/views/views.ts","result":"需要人工确认：生产库迁移要停写大约 4 分钟，什么时候可以做？我建议周六上午 9 点。","entries":[143,144],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e145","entries":[145,145],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"左子健","bound":false},"text":"## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"08:44","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e146","entries":[146,148],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"读取","title":"读取 1 个文件","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","md":[["p",[[0,118]]]],"first":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","entries":[146],"brief":false}},{"kind":"step","content":{"name":"Read","hint":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","meta":"1 分 0 秒","failed":false,"call":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","result":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","entries":[147,148],"brief":false}}]}},"work":true},{"key":"e149","entries":[149,149],"body":{"kind":"received","content":{"tasks":[],"messages":[{"from":{"name":"Lina Park","bound":false},"text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","place":{"name":"修复 Android 上聊天列表滚动掉帧","surface":"chat","session":"k-maple-0"}}]}},"turn":{"time":"08:48","text":"1 步 · 未发消息"}},{"key":"e150","entries":[150,152],"body":{"kind":"group","content":{"summary":"运行","title":"运行 1 条命令","failures":0,"pending":0,"rows":[{"kind":"thought","content":{"text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","